{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1227489-assorted-character-concepts","id":1227489,"title":"Assorted Character Concepts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-14T12:14:42-07:00","id":1227489,"title":"Assorted Character Concepts","content":"Having been inspired by the Book of Secrets, but currently having no group, and, thus, no opportunity to channel that inspiration into a game, I thought I would put my barious character concepts up here. Hopefully someone else can make use of them. I'm not going to do full sheets for them, just short writeups that include the high points.If anyone would like to give me a chance to play these characters let me know.<br /> <br /> E. J.<br /> Tradition: Cult of Ecstasy<br /> Paradigm: We Are All Gods in Disguise<br /> Demeanor/Nature: Rebel/Idelist<br /> Practices/Instruments: Art (music and writing), Fashion (genderbending clothing), Internet Activity (blogs and social media), Transgression (sock puppets), Voice and Vocalization (singing) Energy work (channeling the energy of a crowd)<br /> Spheres: Mind 2 Time 1 Prime 1<br /> Avatar: Dynamic<br /> <br /> E. J. is a genderqueer street performer who uses their presentation in terms of fashion, sound, and lyrics to try and shock people out of their ruts. They also maintain multiple online personas with conflicting, and radical views, and often get in heated cyber arguments with themselves in order to help make their various sets of followers question their rigid beliefs. They Awoke during a concert when they could suddenly feel all the audience's minds, and the great cosmic similarity and beauty behind th4em. Their Avatar is a divine version of themselves which guides them toward achieving their potential.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Leonard Nelson<br /> Tradition: celestial Chorus<br /> Paradigm: All Power Comes From God<br /> Demeanor/Nature:Mystic/Caregiver<br /> Practices/Instruments: God-bonding, True Names (&quot;the power of Christ compels you, etc.), Voice and Vocalization (Oratory/Preaching), Meditation<br /> Spheres: Forces 2, Prime 2<br /> Avatar: Pattern<br /> <br /> Leonard Nelson was raised in a fiairly stereotypical radical fundamentalist family and grew up mostly in isolation. Once he started to actually read the Bible, though, he started finding conflicts between Jesus' message of love and his family's constant drumbeat of hate and fear. This more positive message also resonated with his own compassionate Nature, which, eventually, lead him to Awaken. His mother was beating his sister for some infraction when Leonard became enraged and, serendipitously, a lightning bolt tores through the window and fried her where she stood. His sister screamed and he fled in terror. Exhausted, he took refuge in a church, and the Awakened pastor eventually coaxed the story out of him. Leonard, obviously, takes this serendipitous meeting with his future mentor as more evidence of God's hand. Calmed by the pastor and convinced he couldn't be prosecuted for a freak accident, he returned to his house, but his sister was gone.. He now seeeks to find her again and to help as many other disadvantaged people (especially kids) as he can along the way. He has some grounding in formal theology, but has little more patience for hair-splitting theological debates than he does for the hateful doctrine of his parents. For him, the best way to solve any situation is through compassion and understanding of the people involved, not airy fairy theories. He currently lives with is mentor in the vicarage and works as part of the outreach program of their church. His Avatar could potentially be a divinely actualized version of his sister, but that might shut off the possibility of her still being alive. ST's discretion<br /> <br /> <br /> Heidi Carlson<br /> Tradition: Verbenna<br /> Paradigm: Ancient Wisdom is the Key<br /> Demeanor/Nature: Scholar/Mystic<br /> Practices/Instruments: Animalism, Blood and Fluids, Elementalism,, Ordeals and Exertions, Sex and Sensuality<br /> Spheres: Life 2, Forces 2<br /> Heidi began offering sacrifices and small acts of &quot;worship&quot; o the natural features near her house as a sort of willfl self-deceit. She didn't take it very seriously but pretending she did was more than anything else in her humdrum suburban existence. Then, one day, her house was was on fire and the tree in her yard extended a branch at exactly the right height for her to jump to safely from her second-story window. After this, she thought there might be something more to her games than she had previously supposed. She began to actively study ancient nature religions, becoming more and more convinced of the value of such ancient inishgt. She found herself most strongly drawn to the Norse tradition, both because of her Germanic heriitage, and its pervasive ethos of stubbborn perseverence, defiant joy in the face of hardship, and the exaltation of cleverness (primarily through Odin). Despite these intellectual tendencies, however, she beleives that we must never let veneration of dead scholars and poets trump our recognition of Creation's vitality. Take what you can make practical use of from ancient texts, and leave the rest. This puts her close to both Creation is Divine and Alive and Might is Right, as well asa mystical version of Mechanistic Cosmos. She isn't particularly interested in traditional faith, only in what secrets she can find in various faiths which she can then use to further herself. Her Avatar is a sort of grizzled female Green Man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2336-alokov","name":"alokov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":